=head1 DESCRIPTION

Use this processor to convert a value type associated with the
specified key to the specified type. It's a casting processor that
changes the types of the specified fields. Values can be converted into
one of the following datatypes: C<integer>, C<double>, C<string> and
C<boolean>.

